 "letter_html": "<section class=\"enc-cd-letter enc-cd-letter--medium\"\n         aria-label=\"LLaMa's read on this race\">\n  <header class=\"enc-cd-letter__head\">\n    <span class=\"enc-cd-letter__mono\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🦙</span>\n    <div class=\"enc-cd-letter__title-block\">\n      <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__eyebrow\">LLaMa&rsquo;s read</p>\n      <h2 class=\"enc-cd-letter__title\">Predicted 1&mdash;2&mdash;3&mdash;4</h2>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <ol class=\"enc-cd-letter__slots\">\n    \n      <li class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot enc-cd-letter__slot--pos-1\">\n        <span class=\"enc-cd-letter__medal\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          🥇\n          \n        </span>\n        <div class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-body\">\n          <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-eyebrow\">\n            Predicted\n            1st\n            \n            \n              &middot; <span class=\"enc-cd-letter__price\">13/2</span>\n            \n          </p>\n          <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__horse\">Hebridean Nomad</p>\n          \n            <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-note\">Top of the deterministic model, steamer flag confirmed, distance a positive fit, and Balding&#x27;s yard ticking over at 12% — the money coming for him at 13/2 is the final argument.</p>\n          \n        </div>\n      </li>\n    \n      <li class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot enc-cd-letter__slot--pos-2\">\n        <span class=\"enc-cd-letter__medal\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          🥈\n          \n        </span>\n        <div class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-body\">\n          <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-eyebrow\">\n            Predicted\n            2nd\n            \n            \n              &middot; <span class=\"enc-cd-letter__price\">6/1</span>\n            \n          </p>\n          <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__horse\">Moab</p>\n          \n            <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-note\">A 24lb weight reduction is a seismic signal, Knight&#x27;s yard running at 50% in the past fortnight, and Tom Marquand in the saddle — Moab is the chief danger despite drifting in the market.</p>\n          \n        </div>\n      </li>\n    \n      <li class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot enc-cd-letter__slot--pos-3\">\n        <span class=\"enc-cd-letter__medal\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          🥉\n          \n        </span>\n        <div class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-body\">\n          <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-eyebrow\">\n            Predicted\n            3rd\n            \n            \n              &middot; <span class=\"enc-cd-letter__price\">17/2</span>\n            \n          </p>\n          <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__horse\">Belle of Kt</p>\n          \n            <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-note\">Three wins on the bounce at a higher class, now three classes lower with distance a positive fit — Belle of Kt&#x27;s each-way claims are real at 17/2 despite the going unknown.</p>\n          \n        </div>\n      </li>\n    \n      <li class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot enc-cd-letter__slot--pos-4\">\n        <span class=\"enc-cd-letter__medal\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          4\n        </span>\n        <div class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-body\">\n          <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-eyebrow\">\n            Predicted\n            4th\n            \n              &middot; <span class=\"enc-cd-letter__price\">13/2</span>\n            \n          </p>\n          <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__horse\">Society Girl</p>\n          \n            <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-note\">The highest SR in the field at 75 and sole front-runner — she controls the race but may pay the price for doing so alone over this stamina test.</p>\n          \n        </div>\n      </li>\n    \n  </ol>\n\n  \n    <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__verdict\">Hebridean Nomad is my bet. The steamer signal, the top deterministic model score, the positive distance fit, and Balding&#x27;s yard ticking over — these are four independent signals pointing the same direction. Win, 20 units at 13/2. Conviction band: medium. A credible danger exists in Moab, whose 24lb weight drop is not something to dismiss lightly, and Society Girl&#x27;s front-running position with the highest SR in the field means she must always be feared. On Mr Fox&#x27;s tip — Two Plus Two is 15/2 and drifting, sits in a hold-up position that suits the pace map, and the SR of 68 is workmanlike. But the model has Two Plus Two sixth of six scored runners, the drifter flag is a negative signal, and Ed de Giles&#x27; yard is blank over 14 days. Mr Fox and I split here: the market is moving away from his pick, not toward it, and Hebridean Nomad is the stronger evidence-based call.</p>\n  \n\n  \n    <a class=\"enc-cd-letter__more\" href=\"https://www.saturday-racing.com/letters/bath-2026-09-29/1432/\">\n      Read the full letter &rarr;\n    </a>\n  \n</section>\n",
